/-!
# RcicNativeFamModel — Family-head semantic model (`Approx` / `ApproxFin` / `ApproxI`), `ConvT` βζ/ζ-local soundness, and `famAppRow` interfaces

On `main`, `TypedRowsWf.famAppRow` is reduced to `PiRowField` + `FamAppSaturation` (#7569,
`RcicPiRowSaturation`) + ONE named input: `RelevantSlotConv` (#7525, `RcicFamAppLeftInst`:
from `TyConvT E n Γ (foldApps (.const r ls) xs) (foldApps (.const r ls') xs')` for an admitted
inductive family head `r`, a native `ConvT` of each relevant argument at the left-instantiated
domain; Prop slots are discharged inside the walk by `ConvT.irr`).

ChatGPT #7608 (`admitted_no_raw_star_confluence`) showed the raw reduction relation is NOT
confluent even with K and η-K, so `famAppRow` cannot come from raw confluence valleys.
Following Carneiro–Coquand–Frabetti Mathieu–Lennon-Bertrand–Melliès–Weirich,
*Definitional Inversion, Without Normalisation* (arXiv 2607.13662), and coordinating with
`RcicNativePiModel` (`PiModelAudit`, #7613), `RcicNativePiModelIdeal` / `RcicNativePiModelLR` /
`RcicNativePiModelLRCases` / `RcicNativePiModelLRTerm` (`PiModelIdealAudit`, #7628/#7631/#7635/#7636/#7639/#7645),
`RcicNativePiModelIrr` (`PiModelIrrAudit`, #7633/#7639), and `RcicKernelRowsAssembly` (#7620/#7650),
this module delivers:

1. **§1 — L1-Fam in `Approx` (unconditional model fragment for family heads and spines):**
   - Inversion lemmas `approx_const_inv`, `approx_letE_inv`, `approx_lit_inv`.
   - Pointwise spine approximation `ApproxArgs`, spine introduction (`approx_foldApps_spine`,
     `approx_famApp`), and the inductive spine inversion invariant (`IsSpineExpr`,
     `approx_foldApps_const_inv`).
   - Compact probe vectors `botVec` and `slotVec`, model family-head injectivity
     (`semEq_famApp_inj`, `semEq_famApp_head_length`, `semEq_famApp_slot`), and model
     disjointness (`semEq_pi_famApp_disjoint`, `semEq_sort_famApp_disjoint`).

2. **§2 — L1′-Fam, L2 Substitution (`approx_subst : ApproxSubst`), and Refutation of Singleton Compactness / `TypedSoundnessAtBot` in `Approx`:**
   - Unconditional soundness of `.letE` (`semEq_letE_betaRedex`, `semEq_letE`), `.lit`
     (`semEq_lit`), spine congruence (`SemEqArgs`, `semEq_foldApps`, `semEq_famApp_congr`),
     and `FamCongrFrag` (`semEq_of_famCongrFrag`, `famCongrFrag_famApp_semInj`).
   - Environment inclusion `EnvLe`, monotonicity (`approx_mono`), forward β-soundness
     (`approx_beta_to_substEnv`), and full L2 substitution (`Env.insertAt`, `approx_lift`,
     `approx_instantiate`, `approx_subst : ApproxSubst`).
   - **Refutation of singleton compactness and `TypedSoundnessAtBot` in `Approx`:**
     Because `Cpt.down u := fun c => c = u` (`RcicNativePiModel.lean:82`) binds a variable to
     a single compact `u`, two-occurrence β-redexes refute single-element compactness
     (`not_approxCompact : ¬ ApproxCompact`) and refute `TypedSoundnessAtBot E n` at every
     environment `E` and universe bound `n` (`not_typedSoundnessAtBot : ¬ TypedSoundnessAtBot E n`,
     generalizing #7619). No consumer in this module takes `ApproxCompact` or `TypedSoundnessAtBot`.

3. **§3 — Stored-Telescope `isArity` Decomposition (Reusing Landed `piDomsOf` / `piTailOf` / `piResult`) & Scoped `FamAppSaturation`:**
   - Reuses `main`'s landed `piDomsOf`, `piTailOf` (`RcicIotaShapeAdapter`), `piResult`
     (`RcicFamRef`), `piBody` (`RcicParRedT`), `policyPi_piDomsOf_piTailOf` (`RcicIATypedMinor`),
     `isArity_piResult_sort` (`RcicArity`), and `instantiateLevels_policyPi` (`RcicIotaSRRowsTel`)
     to decompose `m.mtype` and `instantiateLevels ls m.mtype` for any admitted `.inductiveM`
     member under `EnvWfT` (`mtype_policyPi_of_inductiveM`, `instMtype_policyPi_of_inductiveM`),
     and constructs `FamAppSaturation` on the `#7569` scoped route (`famAppSaturation_of_scoped`).

4. **§4 — Finitary Step-Function Domain Model `CptFin` / `ApproxFin`: Constructive Compactness, Substitution, Context Valuation `ctxEnvFin`, and Unconditional 14-Constructor (`FamBetaZetaLocalFrag`) Soundness:**
   - Defines `CptFin` (where step-function entries have finite input lists `U : List CptFin`
     with `CptFin.downList U := fun c => c = .bot ∨ c ∈ U`), `EnvFin`, `ApproxFin`, `SemEqFin`.
   - Proves constructive finitary compactness (`approxFin_compact_at`, `approxFin_compact`),
     lifting and substitution (`approxFin_lift`, `approxFin_instantiate`,
     `approxFin_subst : ApproxFinSubst`), and **unconditional** β and ζ soundness
     (`semEqFin_beta`, `semEqFin_zeta`, `semEqFin_twoOcc_beta`).
   - Defines the context-aware valuation predicate `CtxEnvFin Γ ρ` and canonical context
     environment `ctxEnvFin Γ`, proving `ctxEnvFin_respects : CtxEnvFin Γ (ctxEnvFin Γ)` and
     **unconditional** `ConvT.zetaLocal` soundness (`semEqFin_zetaLocal`).
   - Proves **unconditional** soundness and family/Π injectivity for the 14-constructor
     `ConvT` fragment `FamBetaZetaLocalFrag` (`refl`, `symm`, `trans`, `pi`, `lam`, `app`,
     `letE`, `lit`, `tyConv`, `sorts`, `consts`, `beta`, `zeta`, `zetaLocal`).

5. **§5 — Computational Fragment `FamCompFrag` Soundness, Applied η-Soundness (`semEqFin_eta_app`), Refutation of Unprojected `EtaStepFin`/`TypedSoundnessFin`, Shallow Type-Code Soundness (`ShallowTypeSoundnessFin`), and `WhStepCtx` / `FamLevelAndSlotConv` Equivalences (`↔`):**
   - Proves unconditional applied η-soundness `semEqFin_eta_app` in `ApproxFin`, refutes
     unprojected `EtaStepFin` and `TypedSoundnessFin` on unapplied variables (`not_etaStepFin`,
     `not_typedSoundnessFin`), and proves soundness and family-spine injectivity of the
     computational fragment `FamCompFrag` (`semEqFin_of_famCompFrag`,
     `famCompFrag_famApp_semInjFin`) with inhabitedness witnesses `deltaStepFin_emptyEnv` and
     `iotaStepFin_emptyEnv`.
   - Defines shallow type-code compacts `IsShallowTypeCptFin` (`.sort`, `.pi .bot []`,
     `.spine r (List.replicate k .bot)`) and `ShallowTypeSoundnessFin E n` (which puts `.bot` in
     all argument slots and is therefore unaffected by `eta` and `irr` inside arguments), deriving
     head/length injectivity, constructor disjointness, and `FamAppSaturation`
     (`famAppSaturation_of_shallowSoundnessFin`).
   - Proves that admitted inductive family spines `foldApps (.const r ls) xs` are weak-head
     normal under `WhStepCtx E Γ` (which includes `zetaLocal`, `beta`, `zeta`, `delta`, `iota`,
     `lit`, `appHead`): `whStepCtx_famApp_false`, `whRedCtx_famApp_eq`.
   - Defines `FamLevelAndSlotConv E n Γ m ls ls' xs xs'` (the catalogued residue
     `W-F8-FAMAPP-ARG-COMPARISON` plus head level coherence `eqNList ls ls'`), labels
     `FundamentalFamSpineFin` and `FundamentalFamLR` explicitly as restatements, and proves
     bidirectional equivalences (`↔`) to `FamLevelAndSlotConv`.

6. **§6 — Family-Head Model Fragment & Context-Aware `zetaLocal` Soundness Directly Over `main`'s Ideal Model `CptI` / `EnvI` / `ApproxI` / `SemEqI` / `WhStep` / `WhRed` (`RcicNativePiModelIdeal` + `RcicNativePiModelLR`):**
   - Directly reuses `CptI`, `EnvI`, `ApproxI`, `denI`, `SemEqI`, `approxI_beta`, `approxI_zeta`,
     `WhStep`, `WhRed` from `RcicNativePiModelIdeal` and `RcicNativePiModelLR` (#7628/#7635).
   - Proves spine evaluation and inversion (`ApproxIArgs`, `approxI_foldApps_spine`,
     `approxI_famApp`, `IsSpineExprI`, `approxI_foldApps_const_inv`), compact probes (`botVecI`,
     `slotVecI`), model family-head injectivity (`semEqI_famApp_head_length`,
     `semEqI_famApp_slot`, `semEqI_famApp_inj`), and disjointness (`semEqI_pi_famApp_disjoint`,
     `semEqI_sort_famApp_disjoint`) directly in `SemEqI`.
   - Proves `SemEqI` congruences, set-valued context environments (`CtxEnvI`, `botSetI`,
     `ctxEnvI`, `ctxEnvI_respects`), unconditional `ConvT.zetaLocal` soundness (`semEqI_zetaLocal`),
     unconditional 14-constructor soundness (`semEqI_of_famBetaZetaLocalFrag`,
     `famBetaZetaLocalFrag_famApp_semInjI`), and weak-head normality of admitted family spines
     under `PiModelIdealAudit.WhStep` / `WhRed` (`whStep_famApp_false`, `whRed_famApp_eq`).

7. **§7 — Finitary Projection Dichotomy (`IsPropC` / `CTy` / `tprojI` / `PEqI`), `LRTypeIN` / `LRTermI` Spine Characterization, `zetaLocal` Refutation of Context-Free `EnvI.bot` / `WhStep E` Interfaces, Context-Aware `LRTypeICtx` / `FundamentalLRICtx`, and `ShallowTypeSoundnessCtxI` + `FamSlotPEqSoundnessCtxI` Assembly:**
   - **Part A (Finitary Projection Dichotomy on Family Spines in `RcicNativePiModelIrr`):**
     Characterizes `IsPropC E (.spine r args)` and `IsPropIdealI E (denI ρ (foldApps (.const r ls) xs))`
     via `inductiveSortLevel hW hm hind = .zero`, proves unconditional proof-irrelevance
     `pEqI_irr_famApp_of_zero` and `pEqI_irr_policyPi_famApp_of_zero` at `Prop`-sorted families,
     and proves `tprojI` identity and `PEqI` spine injectivity / disjointness at relevant sorts
