   - **Part B (`WhNormal`, `LRTypeIN` / `LRTypeI` / `LRTermI` Normal-Spine Equivalences, `zetaLocal` Refutation of `TypeSoundnessI` / `FundamentalLRI` / `FundamentalLRIN` / `FundamentalLRINT` / `FundamentalTermI`, and Context-Aware Repair `LRTypeICtx` / `FundamentalLRICtx`):**
