     `whRedCtx_zetaSortCtx_bvar0`). Defines the repaired context-aware logical relation
     `LRTypeICtx` and `FundamentalLRICtx`, deriving `PiRowField` and `FamAppSaturation`
     without any refuted premise (`piRowField_of_fundamentalLRICtx`,
     `famAppSaturation_of_fundamentalLRICtx`).
   - **Part C (`FamCompFrag` Soundness in `ApproxI`, Unconditional `semEqI_eta_app` / `semEqI_eta_lam`, Refutation of Unprojected `EtaStepI` / `TypedSoundnessCtxI`, and Non-Vacuous `ShallowTypeSoundnessCtxI` + `FamSlotPEqSoundnessCtxI` Assembly):**
     Proves unconditional η-soundness on applied terms and lambdas (`semEqI_eta_app`,
     `semEqI_eta_lam`), refutes unprojected `EtaStepI` and `TypedSoundnessCtxI` (`not_etaStepI`,
     `not_typedSoundnessCtxI`), proves computational fragment soundness `semEqI_of_famCompFrag` /
