     projected slot equality `FamSlotPEqSoundnessCtxI`.

8. **§8 — Context-Aware Weak-Head Determinism & Invariance (`WhNormalCtx`, `WhDetCtx`), Normalized Family-Injective Logical Relation (`LRTypeFamIN` / `FundamentalLRFamINT`), Family Adequacy (`AdequacyFamICtx`), and Top-Level `RcicKernelRowsAssembly` Wiring (#7620/#7650):**
