/-- **Unconditional `ConvT.irr` Case at Any Π-Proposition `.pi A B` (`fundConvFamIN_irr_pi`):**
    Directly resolves `RcicNativePiModelTermIrr.not_irrCaseT_of_pi_member` (#7640/#7648): for any
    `.pi A B` sorted in `Prop`, `LRTermFamIN E n Γ p q (.pi A B) u` holds unconditionally for all
