/-- **Unconditional `ConvT.irr` Case at Any Admitted `.inductiveM` Proposition Family Spine
    (`fundConvFamIN_irr_famApp`):**
    For any admitted `.inductiveM` family spine `foldApps (.const r ls) xs` sorted in `Prop`,
    `LRTermFamIN E n Γ p q (foldApps (.const r ls) xs) u` holds unconditionally for all `p, q, u`. -/
theorem fundConvFamIN_irr_famApp {E : ResolvedEnv} {n : Nat} {Γ : LCtx} (hW : EnvWfT E)
    {r : Nat} {m : CheckedMember} (hm : E.members r = some m) (hind : m.mclass = .inductiveM)
    {ls : List Level} {xs : List (Expr Nat)}
