  fundConvFamIN_irr_of_nonSortPropCtx (isNonSortPropCtx_famApp hW hm hind hP) p q

/-- **Unconditional Term-Level K at Any `Prop`-Valued Admitted Inductive Family Result
    (`fundConvFamIN_K_famApp`):**
    For any eliminator application `.app R h` and minor `m₀` at a `Prop`-sorted admitted
    `.inductiveM` family spine `foldApps (.const r ls) xs`, `LRTermFamIN` relates `.app R h` and
    `m₀` at every compact `u`. -/
theorem fundConvFamIN_K_famApp {E : ResolvedEnv} {n : Nat} {Γ : LCtx} (hW : EnvWfT E)
