/-- **Refutation of §13's `LRTypeFamINBiR` on All Three `W-K-OPEN` Benchmarks (`trueVarSort`, `trueVarPi`, `trueVarFam`):** -/
theorem not_lrTypeFamINBiR_trueVarSort (n : Nat) :
